@startuml
skinparam dpi 150
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam wrapWidth 140
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #44546A
skinparam activity {
  BackgroundColor #EAF1FB
  BorderColor #44546A
}
skinparam swimlane {
  BorderColor #8497B0
  TitleBackgroundColor #D9E2F3
}

|Investor|
start
:Decide to review the portfolio (about once a month);
|Broker app|
:Log in, open the positions list;
:Read tickers, quantities and values **(P1)**;
|Investor|
:Export a statement or copy positions **(P3)**;
|Spreadsheet|
:Paste positions into the sheet;
:Update prices by hand or by a formula;
:Type target weights copied from a book or an article **(P2)**;
:Calculate current weights and deviation;
|Investor|
:Judge the gap, decide what to add;
|Websites and chatbot|
:Open price, news, dividend and fundamentals pages per ticker **(P4)**;
|Investor|
if (Needs an explanation?) then (yes)
  |Websites and chatbot|
  :Paste the portfolio into a general chatbot **(P5)**;
  |Investor|
else (no)
endif
:Place the order at the broker;
stop
@enduml